  ('strategy-seed-smart-money-large-bullish-premium', 'smart-money-large-bullish-premium', 'Large Bullish Options Premium (QuantData, Needs Data)', 'QuantData market-wide options premium flow (flow_market_premium gainers-losers, >= $100,000 per trade; QuantData bullish class includes sold puts as well as bought calls, so this signal is named large bullish premium and never call flow). Complete sessions settle after midnight and entry occurs at the next session open (zero look-ahead) in an equal-weight 10-slot portfolio in excess of SPY at 10 bps/side. Available complete history spans 284 sessions from 2025-10-16 to 2026-11-20 (~13.1 months), below the pre-registered 24-month out-of-sample holdout (>= 490 sessions). Verdict: needs-more-data. Frozen rule top10-500k (each session the top 10 liquid tickers by net bullish premium among those with bullish premium >= $500,000, bullish share >= 70% and >= 3 trades, H=20) is recorded at N=1 with zero parameter sweep so future out-of-sample testing remains uncontaminated; full verdict evaluation unlocks on 2027-10-16. Descriptive baseline over the observed window: 140 entries, excess CAGR -18.84%, excess Sharpe -0.981, max DD -24.14%, win rate 50.7% (no OOS verdict yet). Limits: insufficient history (< 2 years), bullish taxonomy aggregates bought calls and sold puts, EOD capture delay, underlying equity study only. Spec: docs/specs/strategies/smart-money-large-bullish-premium.md. Research only.', 'python', 'researching', 'docs/specs/strategies/smart-money-large-bullish-premium.md', '["research-only","smart-money","options-flow","daily","needs-data","backtest-study"]'::jsonb, 'Idea discovery', '[]'::jsonb)
